ghost-role-information-dcom-description = A member of PDV's Dynasty Commando special forces.
ghost-role-information-dcom-rules = You are a member of the [color=#D2B48C][bold]PDV faction[/bold][/color]. You should generally not seek to harm your fellow faction members or their ships.
                                             As a member of [color=#D2B48C][bold]PDV's Dynasty Commandos[/bold][/color], you only take orders from [color=#D2B48C][bold]PDV high command[/bold][/color]. This is only members of The Sultanate, or the game staff.
                                             You don't remember any of your previous life, and you don't remember anything you learned as a ghost.
                                             You are allowed to remember knowledge about the game in general, such as how to cook, how to use objects, etc.
                                             You are absolutely [color=red]NOT[/color] allowed to remember the name, appearance, etc. of your previous character.